"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫If you do not put them into words, your feelings will never make it through to anyone."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫Si vous n’exprimez pas vos sentiments, ils resteront lettre morte pour vos proches."

#: scenario3:scenario3_2DB55ED7_BC6A_4C0E_8B54_8EF9ED930FDA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
