msgid "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫He failed to communicate to anyone what he held within his breast."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫Il échoua à communiquer ce qu’il avait dans le cœur à ses proches."

#: scenario3:scenario3_6CEB79CF_4400_4325_9C8E_F68A55F1FC7C
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 06c77440687e03ea437fb3fa47acf61e463591f98c67d9bfb32eb998901c7188
