msgid "⟪k:0⟫After enough time, he likely forgot ⟪k:1⟫how⟪k:2⟫ to be genuine at all."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Au bout d’un moment, il est probable qu’il avait oublié ⟪k:1⟫comment⟪k:2⟫ être sincère."

#: scenario3:scenario3_013A8F6E_378F_4BE7_B040_467ED783B8B4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: eff1b8415fba81db32857b2ae67fefeaa3bfbfa0e9003c0102634ad7f94281d6
