msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_8827CF43_922A_4FB4_BA34_A1243995CC33"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫In any event, there are many things in this world that cannot be communicated without being "
"put into words."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫En tout cas, il y a beaucoup de choses dans ce monde qui ne peuvent être communiquées sans "
"qu’on les mette en mots."

#: scenario3:scenario3_EB6F7602_33C3_4CDF_B2EB_BAAE31BDFAC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: c20fe95e16cb3654c2e451162b574d0c786bb29dfb5fa752658afecdbc0428c7
#. default-sha256: 647dca763f61266ad9eff737541162922a61a8b4c12be62623d9335e5e452a7c
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_EB6F7602_33C3_4CDF_B2EB_BAAE31BDFAC8"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How sad that his tale should end without him expressing how he truly felt."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Quelle tristesse que ce conte se termine sans qu’il ait pu exprimer ses vrais sentiments."

#: scenario3:scenario3_479B4671_C193_4DFB_BFF9_1DCFB80CED03
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 6febdbb1428077e64bcc26c4d2cb96d1b21952926890f80111c5d07d12d09415
#. default-sha256: 7968bf98a12fe86f61c3c0bcd0298a3d3900a74e7bc5362a1a2bc1237a430db2
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_479B4671_C193_4DFB_BFF9_1DCFB80CED03"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫How hard it must have been... ⟪k:1⟫to never clear up his misunderstandings."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Comme cela a dû être dur... ⟪k:1⟫de ne jamais clarifier ces malentendus."

#: scenario3:scenario3_220C8F9A_8DBA_448D_B3E7_7BC0AFD1733B
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b99de4cd04d716e9cbd5868b40b187ab889d5c2c50c84342c174673d19cd00d9
#. default-sha256: 8861a505b93ed29454fb1166647f37ca6d1a6162d220ced8cf219e1becf688ad
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_220C8F9A_8DBA_448D_B3E7_7BC0AFD1733B"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫...After Jacopo’s confrontation with Maria, the Pacific Railroad was completed, as scheduled."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫...Après l’affrontement entre Jacopo et Maria, la ligne du Pacifique fut achevée comme prévu."

#: scenario3:scenario3_11CC5E32_3653_409F_B9CD_6E3246AD83AA
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bd1a778792b917a38c3f9df77b6153c89a8238ea25059aca69bb3df939d14e8e
#. default-sha256: 16db66dc325639de8300949a8c088acc7ed5c1ff510908ad2898afcda73566c8
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_11CC5E32_3653_409F_B9CD_6E3246AD83AA"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Celebratory cheers shook the New World as the last spike was driven into the rails. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Jacopo, however, could not even manage a smile listening to the telegraph."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Des cris de célébration ébranlèrent le Nouveau Monde tandis que le dernier clou était posé "
"dans les rails. ⟪k:1⟫Jacopo, pourtant, ne réussit même pas à sourire en écoutant le télégraphe."

#: scenario3:scenario3_383C8844_8D4C_4391_8D58_066B56908012
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 407e3af44aa0b2dfc93a5e7870dc99917a4e9d8ff6dcbc6af37ad87a21af66d6
#. default-sha256: 394a3bd52fb690e67fd214d4a4bae907d87ccdd9bf281e4f0edaec7f035a31dc
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_383C8844_8D4C_4391_8D58_066B56908012"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫And I am sure you can take a guess as to why. ⟪k:1⟫The people with whom he wished to share "
"that moment were not there."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Et je suis sûre que vous pouvez deviner pourquoi. ⟪k:1⟫Les gens avec lesquels il aurait "
"voulu partager ce moment n’étaient pas là."

#: scenario3:scenario3_5224486A_9E1D_47CA_9EF1_AAFEBAFC0F8F
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 0cf6ffa3be08c25414ce82f6ef31e9087568d1899646376ee0bdb635489ba57f
#. default-sha256: 98c63fa9e5ee977b0e89190b14629967b67c600e33acab6a1f22c19bb5f1bc5b
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_5224486A_9E1D_47CA_9EF1_AAFEBAFC0F8F"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫Shortly following her death, Jacopo held a private funeral for Maria. ⟪k:1⟫Then, he "
"commenced a search for the White-Haired Girl."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Peu après la mort de Maria, Jacopo organisa des funérailles privées en son honneur. ⟪k:1⟫"
"Puis, il se mit en quête de la Fille aux Cheveux Blancs."

#: scenario3:scenario3_A1D3D806_78F0_4920_A88A_223A680E8CD4
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7d8efebd77f6d831f3b00ca71333428386e4f0fe2b871e07e7d99d8ef3b976a7
#. default-sha256: 13bd8fed70b1fdec50378ad79b2a1b77d87195eee5d972deb89dd368523b7bd5
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_A1D3D806_78F0_4920_A88A_223A680E8CD4"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫But he did not do so alone—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫he hired others to help, did everything in his power to "
"find her, tirelessly searching for many, many years."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Mais il ne le fit pas tout seul—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ il engagea d’autres personnes pour l’aider, il "
"fit tout ce qui était en son pouvoir pour la retrouver, remua ciel et terre pendant de nombreuses "
"années."

#: scenario3:scenario3_3A5B0260_4BEF_4255_A2A2_1EF512A712D7
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 075d96733f5b37b068e01c7f115707629817fdd442422e81d0bc07b9df7c1697
#. default-sha256: be702d614e94a4f270e9d5272d87f3878461dd4f7260227e4a1a5a2e44224d4e
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_3A5B0260_4BEF_4255_A2A2_1EF512A712D7"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫However, he never was able to locate her..."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Mais il ne la retrouva jamais..."

#: scenario3:scenario3_747019C5_BC7E_41AE_80E0_782A494BD804
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: cf8b085cbfb0f9929943704b1984c344a65d2d143c29fac7c8859c48b3cc100f
#. default-sha256: ba4728e5e6b457c0256006cf57a7910d8993cfdfb7138588cf241bc82921c7ac
msgctxt "scenario3:scenario3_747019C5_BC7E_41AE_80E0_782A494BD804"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫and he spent the remainder of his life alone."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫...et il passa le restant de sa vie seul."

#: scenario3:scenario3_038F3D17_FFA7_49DC_B250_DAF31C840EC8
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 191a31a0637fd46cdde87881e2dc0660578462c92426e2455b93e53071482160
